{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"19b5971493feecb52305814cf6cd37535a7f38fabbda966a7a4899a514873981","ja":"努力の成果","zh":"努力的成果","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"a549c5d70101636feab83f490bd2568ade40a5e2b2026b5f463b975106e56cd2","ja":"未来の撮影当日……","zh":"未来拍摄当天……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"cedbded63febf33bb6c5fbc7aea2b5afc72e3604bcfa53477a16ec34fbcb65f6","ja":"（うん！　けっこう歩いたけど、まだまだ元気！\nみんなが体力づくりに協力してくれたおかげだな♪）","zh":"（嗯！虽然走了挺久，但我还精神着呢！\n这多亏了大家帮我一起锻炼体力呀♪）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f2a0c1b1b4469b0b0ffab73d3b87779382cc777f5dbb6f96a33c67b0afd534d6","ja":"よ～しっ！　この調子で残りの撮影も……あれ？\n急に止まった……？","zh":"好～嘞！照这个势头把剩下的拍摄也……咦？\n突然停住了……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"dcb870a12c222eee4d5bf7c6ac7234f24fa6ec45f6224b91f3a6d3cf846edbd3","ja":"あの～！　スタッフさん、どうしたんですか～？","zh":"那个～！工作人员，发生什么事了吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"10340a839019597957aed8dd720405706e735f1008e79f767d9887e3b986338e","ja":"「すみません春日さん！　TVでここが紹介された\nらしくって、この先すごく混雑していて……」","zh":"“不好意思，春日小姐！好像是因为电视上介绍了\n这里，前面特别拥挤……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"1d5b327c4c9a1ca99f623e3b5e485c193d875688c61314a330afe02f10f28d88","ja":"えっ、じゃあ、撮影はもう無理なんですか？","zh":"咦，那么，是已经没办法拍摄了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"0eb7ebffa0b9e2fd1d0cf1f30d5673acfc4bb2d90bbfaec755603467f0d71e1b","ja":"「そうですね……上級コースならできそうですが、\nあそこは、かなりキツイしな……」","zh":"“是啊……高级雪道的话应该能滑，\n但那里相当吃力呢……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5babb6860ba916551f501d56f6a64f07e6e5ce0b50220524bd505c728f286af5","ja":"上級コース……あの、あとは\n私の撮影だけですよね？　じゃあ、いけます！　","zh":"高级路线……那个，之后\n只要拍我的部分就行了吧？那我可以的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4db8945e5a3a0579b0faf6c8c94b2c307503a546f1523c3db08ef47e9192b43b","ja":"今日の撮影のために、すっごく鍛えてきましたから！\n登山の装備も、バッチリですよ♪","zh":"为了今天的拍摄，我可是狠狠锻炼过了！\n登山装备也准备得万无一失哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"231255d1193cadedb7d419dbb66c0b1f0dd416bed4e82c5eb23856c465bb28cd","ja":"「そうですか！？　助かります！\nそれじゃあ早速、移動しましょう！」","zh":"「是吗！？帮大忙了！\n那我们马上出发吧！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f8c67fdf6c0d75ee7086cfced6952aff8ceaaaa173d2db15ada57080adcaaf38","ja":"次の日……","zh":"第二天……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"53b893163947e91ff1363346f1e0c8ce1ef50528cf8351a1a6012b5c524c80c6","ja":"わぁ～、あの山の上級者コースに登ったの？","zh":"哇～，爬了那座山的高级路线吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"a89df94f7cb65f8489effb855d467a92984e855fb55016674c5b649cf6831a8f","ja":"嬉しいな～♪　登ってる人、\n私以外に、あんまり見たことなかったから。","zh":"好开心啊～♪ 因为除了我以外，\n平时很少见到有人在爬呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"9e82906b296834f40af1752c137bcf3a29d2240f0839143847de62f06d5eb029","ja":"それって、かなり過酷ってことなんですよね？","zh":"也就是说，会非常严苛对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"e02bc70e5cfd99b01ab5be1cbbad5d05425897bf47a90029a91f906f592cae72","ja":"でへへ～♪　みんなが協力してくれたお陰で、\nなんとか登りきれたよ！","zh":"嘿嘿～♪　多亏了大家的协助，\n总算爬到顶了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"cb3e6399936051aa32a77fb2cc42986589504a8623ff38c3a18cba908e5d03ac","ja":"よかったです！\n映画の公開、楽しみにしていますね♪","zh":"太好了！\n很期待电影上映呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"36fefb0d5e8542b0dbe1a7ee1c089c3f09f7912c9b418bbe9d0d620a0f4f4ce3","ja":"ありがとう♪　あと、映画関連の雑誌とか、\n番宣とかも楽しみにしててね！","zh":"谢谢♪　还有，电影相关的杂志啦、\n宣传节目之类的，也要好好期待哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"10d76b62c4311a8e38d1ba8ed5ad97b0ce35c4e0610ad4cff7bf5c9a445a13b9","ja":"みんなのお陰だってこと、\nいっぱい、いーっぱい話すから！","zh":"因为这全都是托了大家的福，\n我一定会好好地、大讲特讲一番的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"dd7de4b6761a185dc29e842e0a798918b14191cde059475ca2d0e498c6c8bf31","ja":"そんな、私たちは未来さんを応援しただけです。\n話題に出してもらうほどのことは……。","zh":"没那回事，我们只是给未来打气而已。\n根本不值当特地拿出来提……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1507.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"4703fd25fd79a69373b3244556d68352666250b7ef89b729dc22ac5b30b3d795","ja":"だからこそ、だよ！　私ががんばれたのは「応援」の\nおかげだって、ちゃーんとみんなに伝えたいんだ♪","zh":"正因如此，才更要这么做呀！我想好好传达给所有人，\n多亏了大家的“支持”，我才能坚持努力下来♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
